\lim_{x\rightarrow0^{\pm}}\frac{F\left(x\right)}{G\left(x\right)}=\lim_{x\rightarrow0^{\pm}}\frac{f\left(\frac{1}{x}\right)}{g\left(\frac{1}{x}\right)}=\lim_{x\rightarrow\pm\infty}\frac{f\left(x\right)}{g\left(x\right)}
