\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\sin^{\left(n\right)}\left(x\right)=\begin{cases}
\sin x & n\equiv0\mod 4\\
\cos x & n\equiv1\mod 4\\
-\sin x & n\equiv2\mod 4\\
-\cos x & n\equiv3\mod 4
\end{cases}
\]

\end_inset

מכאן שב-
\begin_inset Formula $x=0$
\end_inset

